{"v":4,"catch":"能在Nintendo Switch遊玩的Famicom遊戲集","desc":"《Family Computer Nintendo Classics》收錄了可輕鬆遊玩的Famicom遊戲。\n\n即使不連接網路，也可從選單畫面選擇想玩的遊戲並立即遊玩。要隨時隨地儲存並中斷遊戲也沒問題，即使是很短的時間，也可輕鬆遊玩。\n\n若分享Joy-Con，就可兩人遊玩。大量收錄簡單的對戰和協力遊戲，讓人可不斷切換遊戲進行對戰遊玩。","publisher":"Nintendo","release":"2019-04-23","genres":["其他"],"players":"單機 1–2 人 · 網路 2 人","langs":["日文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a0bf6805a64047aaf8aef2fa3424b043e15985b814bf6536d41890d05393cf02.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/48730d8319e73f2a87b9c88c774c26fae7053cb3b5151a75de542a00e960e626.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2b615da326ea78e667d82a62e41a96a8baf604f2f93bb1edae5f2518dd72b31a.jpg"],"titleId":"0100b4e00444c000","dlc":[]}